>NAGANO, HIDEKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ZEXEL VALEO CLIMATE CONTROL CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUKUSHIMA KOJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IRIE KAZUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGANO HIDEKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUSHIMA, KOJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IRIE, KAZUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGANO, HIDEKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An air conditioning unit for car which is stored in a space formed of a vehicle panel (7) separating an engine compartment from a cabin, an instrument panel (5) installed in the cabin, and a floor panel (6) installed on the floor of the cabin, wherein a bracket part (20) supporting an audio device (40) is formed integrally with a unit case part (10) positioned at the lateral center part of a vehicle, on the longitudinal rear side of the vehicle, an upper end fixed plate (31) of the bracket part (20) and the lower end fixed plate (33) of it are fixed to the instrument panel (5) and the floor panel (6) through bolts and pins, respectively, and a case fixing plate (36) is fixed to a bracket (51) of a steering member (50) through bolts.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur une unité de climatisation pour voiture logée dans un espace délimité par le panneau (7) séparant le compartiment moteur de l'habitacle, le tableau de bord (5), et le plancher (6) de l'habitacle. Son système de fixation comporte une bride (20) support d'un dispositif audio (40) et partie intégrante d'un boîtier (10) situé sur le côté du centre et sur le côté arrière longitudinal du véhicule, une plaque (31) fixée à l'extrémité supérieure de la bride (20) et une plaque (33) fixée à son extrémité inférieure respectivement reliées au tableau de bord (5) et au plancher par des boulons et des vis, et une plaque de fixation (36) fixée par des boulons à une bride (51) d'un élément de la direction.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>